    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>allocator of MeshLib containers that benefit from mimalloc: mimalloc explicitly, std::allocator in Emscripten builds, where malloc is mimalloc already (-sMALLOC=mimalloc), and with MRMESH_NO_MIMALLOC; a class rather than an alias, so that container types are spelled the same on all platforms (e.g. in the C bindings generated once); the bindings only see it as a template argument of containers </para>
    </detaileddescription>
